guardhp=5
facing=E
intro=THE LAST VAULT IS FULL OF TRICKS: SIGNS, TRAPS, A FOUNTAIN, A GLOWING CIRCLE AND WALLS THAT ARE NOT WHAT THEY SEEM. THE THIRD AMULET LIES BEHIND AN IRON DOOR.
